sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User/Frontend
    participant A as Backend API
    participant G as Google OAuth
    participant DB as Database

    Note over U,DB: Fluxo Login Tradicional

    %% Login tradicional
    U->>A: POST /auth/login<br/>{email, password}
    A->>DB: SELECT user WHERE email
    A->>A: Verificar bcrypt password
    A->>A: Gerar access_token (15min)
    A->>A: Gerar refresh_token (1 dia)
    A->>DB: INSERT refresh_token<br/>{user_id, token_hash, expires_at}
    A->>U: {accessToken, refreshToken, user}

    Note over U,DB: Fluxo OpenID Connect - Google OAuth

    %% Iniciar OAuth
    U->>A: POST /auth/google<br/>{redirectUri}
    A->>A: Gerar state (CSRF)
    A->>U: {authUrl, state}
    U->>G: Redirect para authUrl

    %% Autorização Google
    G->>G: User login/consent
    G->>U: Redirect callback<br/>?code=xxx&state=yyy

    %% Callback
    U->>A: GET /auth/google/callback<br/>?code=xxx&state=yyy
    A->>A: Validar state
    
    %% Trocar code por tokens
    A->>G: POST /oauth2/v4/token<br/>{code, client_id, client_secret}
    G->>A: {access_token, id_token}

    %% Validar ID Token
    A->>G: GET /.well-known/jwks
    G->>A: {public_keys}
    A->>A: Validar assinatura ID Token
    A->>A: Validar claims (iss, aud, exp)
    A->>A: Extrair dados user<br/>{sub, email, name, picture}

    %% Criar/Atualizar usuário
    A->>DB: SELECT user WHERE google_id=sub
    alt Usuário não existe
        A->>DB: INSERT user<br/>{google_id, email, name, avatar_url}
    else Usuário existe
        A->>DB: UPDATE user<br/>{name, avatar_url}
    end

    %% Gerar tokens aplicação
    A->>A: Gerar access_token (15min)
    A->>A: Gerar refresh_token (1 dia)
    A->>DB: INSERT refresh_token<br/>{user_id, token_hash, expires_at}

    A->>U: {accessToken, refreshToken, user}

    Note over U,DB: Fluxo de Refresh Token

    %% Refresh token - apenas renova access token
    U->>A: POST /auth/refresh<br/>{refreshToken}
    A->>DB: SELECT refresh_token WHERE token_hash
    A->>A: Validar token não expirado/revogado
    A->>A: Gerar novo access_token (15min)
    A->>U: {accessToken}

    Note over U,DB: Fluxo de Logout

    %% Logout
    U->>A: POST /auth/logout<br/>{refreshToken}
    A->>DB: UPDATE refresh_token<br/>SET revoked_at = NOW()
    A->>U: Success

